Shoalcade build fix: the core's version string ("v2.0.0-<commit>") must name LRPS2's own commit.
`git rev-parse --short HEAD` ran in CMake's build folder, so it named whatever Git repository that folder sat in
(or nothing), not LRPS2. Run it in the LRPS2 source folder. No effect on the emulator itself.

diff --git a/cmake/BuildParameters.cmake b/cmake/BuildParameters.cmake
--- a/cmake/BuildParameters.cmake
+++ b/cmake/BuildParameters.cmake
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@ set(PCSX2_DEFS "")
 
 execute_process(
     COMMAND git rev-parse --short HEAD
+    WORKING_DIRECTORY ${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}
     OUTPUT_VARIABLE GIT_VERSION
     OUTPUT_STRIP_TRAILING_WHITESPACE
 )
